    "detailed_description": "&quot;TouHou Music Recording&quot; is a TouHou doujin rhythm game with recording playmode.<br />\r\nPlayers will play a role in gensokyo, travel across gensokyo, while recording various songs on the way.<br />\r\nIn &quot;Free Mode&quot;, players can choose songs for free, and enjoy the rhythm.<br />\r\nIn &quot;Travel Mosde&quot;, players can unlock songs, read mainline stories and challenge themselves.<br />\r\nIn &quot;My Album&quot;, players can import their own songs and charts with customized skins.<br />\r\nFollow the rhythm of music, press your keyboard and enjoy the fun of recording !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game, we have multiple playscenes, they correspond to different music vehicles and genre.<br />\r\nPlate mode: 5k with arc tracks. The genre is orchestra and piano.<br />\r\nTape mode: 4k with overlapped tracks. The genre is 8-bit, EDM and metal.<br />\r\nMusic box mode: 6k with circle tracks. The genre is music box genre.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur game community QQ: 1061159117",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;TouHou Music Recording&quot; is a TouHou doujin rhythm game with recording playmode.<br />\r\nPlayers will play a role in gensokyo, travel across gensokyo, while recording various songs on the way.<br />\r\nIn &quot;Free Mode&quot;, players can choose songs for free, and enjoy the rhythm.<br />\r\nIn &quot;Travel Mosde&quot;, players can unlock songs, read mainline stories and challenge themselves.<br />\r\nIn &quot;My Album&quot;, players can import their own songs and charts with customized skins.<br />\r\nFollow the rhythm of music, press your keyboard and enjoy the fun of recording !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game, we have multiple playscenes, they correspond to different music vehicles and genre.<br />\r\nPlate mode: 5k with arc tracks. The genre is orchestra and piano.<br />\r\nTape mode: 4k with overlapped tracks. The genre is 8-bit, EDM and metal.<br />\r\nMusic box mode: 6k with circle tracks. The genre is music box genre.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur game community QQ: 1061159117",
    "short_description": "Another incident hit Gensokyo,in totally SILENCE. This time, Hieda no Akyuu- the girl buried in Gensokyo Chronicles, now was pulled up to fix the history on her own! &quot;TouHou Music Recording&quot; is dedicated to all Touhou Music lovers. Be prepared to start a bizarre journey with Akuu right now.",
